  "notes": "MVP utility-cost matrix: onlineboutique homepage-only, 4 policies x 3 budgets x 3 faults. delay=250ms/50% chosen so trace-level p95 (~470ms) stays below tail_low threshold (500ms) while exceeding tail_mid (300ms) and tail_high (200ms); controller detects via p95_ratio ~2.0 > medium threshold 1.5."
